 of her arms are dangling loosely. However, she can still caress Alfonse with her other arm. If possible, part of the red hosiery and golden high-heeled shoes that Veronica wears under her dress must be in-frame. The scene takes place in a royal castle's lush garden.\n\nI'll leave the composition details up to you, so that this concept can be illustrated as beautifully as possible. Veronica's dainty beauty must be a main priority.\n\nhttps://www.intsys.co.jp/goods/fireemblem-figure/06.html", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@SddcARCxyjLYx2l/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2487659, "client_id": 886564, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e8efc39/uploads/origins/4038a571-33fc-4605-b645-8c9a949eb5a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7514a74fc2268c7d9c34c78f8784b714", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9e8efc39/uploads/origins/4038a571-33fc-4605-b645-8c9a949eb5a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7514a74fc2268c7d9c34c78f8784b714, https://si.imgix.net/9e8efc39/uploads/origins/4038a571-33fc-4605-b645-8c9a949eb5a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82507d1091f100764435c4839aa59c41 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9e8efc39/uploads/origins/4038a571-33fc-4605-b645-8c9a949eb5a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba84d405a258feb5bf14e35b2e0c7b79 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e8efc39/uploads/origins/4038a571-33fc-4605-b645-8c9a949eb5a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1458b50a1dfc0d2e01d391eaabc777f2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9e8efc39/uploads/origins/4038a571-33fc-4605-b645-8c9a949eb5a9?bg=%23fff&a