gently hugs her.\n\nSome important final details: For romantic effect, there must be some hearts and stars floating around Eclat's head to represent that he is utterly enraptured by the kiss.\nIn addition, one copy of the following symbol must also be floating around Eclat's head:\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/ecnpae.png\n\nThe symbol represents Seidr's \"Time's Grip\" (時の陥穽) power, which freezes or loops time. The idea is that this is a neverending New Year's kiss.\n\nI'd like to share the illustration on SNS (Reddit). I'd be giving credit to the artist and linking to your profile.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@SddcARCxyjLYx2l/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2487659, "client_id": 255335, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88def9b5/uploads/origins/02c4c8db-4852-45e2-a255-2edbabcaa73c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5111ec081c78182f767b94d08e81f28", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88def9b5/uploads/origins/02c4c8db-4852-45e2-a255-2edbabcaa73c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5111ec081c78182f767b94d08e81f28, https://si.imgix.net/88def9b5/uploads/origins/02c4c8db-4852-45e2-a255-2edbabcaa73c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e37d799781aef8f1ec561f6617d81f85 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88def9b5/uploads/origins/02c4c8db-4852-45e2-a255-2edbabcaa73c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee27bfc44c18cb14692cf40827a82baa 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88def9b5/uploads/origins/02c4c8db-4852-45e2-a255-2edbabcaa73c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eb018862a71883c1cce7b3ec1cb68495", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88def9b5/uploads/origins/02c4c8db-4852-45e2-a255-2edbabcaa73c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eb018862a71883c1cce7b3ec1cb68495, https://si.imgix.net/88def9b5/uploads/origins/02c4c8db-4852-45e2-a255-2edbabcaa73c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8767f3a9e323fcf6a9ce70fe98ca2250 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88def9b5/uploads/origins/02c4c8db-4852-45e2-a255-2edbabcaa73c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8cf1b60b0d8d709c6989a3f28d2233f1 3x"}, "body": "Please draw Scabiosa from Fire Emblem Heroes.\nhttps://i.imgur.com/Hb1w5Y9.png\nDraw her kissing the Summoner Eclat from Fire Emblem Heroes\nhttps://fireemblem.fandom.com/wiki/Kiran/Gallery\nThe summoner is masculine, but has a hood over the eyes.\n\nScabiosa is cool, but also cute. Draw her wings, the vines in her hair, and her makeup. Her skin is very pale, and her ears are pointed, but her ears are usually not visible. She is cold and distant, but is trying to be affectionate in the moment.\n\nhttps://fireemblem.fandom.com/wiki/Triandra/Gallery", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@SddcARCxyjLYx2l/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2487659, "client_id": 629526, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4bcfb47b/uploads/origins/a8dc4484-3977-48b1-b8ff-e19867c6728b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b33340f4d9e0abbd89db35de48f44f7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4bcfb47b/uploads/origins/a8dc4484-3977-48b1-b8ff-e19867c6728b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b33340f4d9e0abbd89db35de48f44f7, https://si.imgix.net/4bcfb47b/uploads/origins/a8dc4484-3977-48b1-b8ff-e19867c6728b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7dc7b8e68255e14bf2baa311808c178 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4bcfb47b/uploads/origins/a8dc4484-3977-48b1-b8ff-e19867c6728b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=629a7ce1ab56b55d1fc26bd8e437326a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4bcfb47b/uploads/origins/a8dc4484-3977-48b1-b8ff-e19867c6728b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a5a73b587a6e142d244a33226c02a154", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4bcfb47b/uploads/origins/a8dc4484-3977-48b1-b8ff-e19867c6728b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a5a73b587a6e142d244a33226c02a154, https://si.imgix.net/4bcfb47b/uploads/origins/a8dc4484-3977-48b1-b8ff-e19867c6728b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=097c804b6f8d234bc2d7c17a24de3ea9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4bcfb47b/uploads/origins/a8dc4484-3977-48b1-b8ff-e19867c6728b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e14403a2781b17a2216762af68ac4c20 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I really enjoy your art and would like to make a request!\n\nCharacter: Morgan from Fire Emblem Awakening (left image of reference).  \n\nOutfit: Please have Morgan wear Lucina's queen outfit (right image of reference).  \n\nExpression/Pose/Background: If possible, I would like a dynamic or action pose. I will leave the rest of the details free for you to decide. Please do something you are comfortable with.  \n\nImportant information:  \n- Morgan should have the same blue colored hair and eyes as Lucina (the women from the right image of reference).  \n- I would also like the sword and shield from the reference image to be included. If possible, please avoid covering too much of the body behind the shield.  \n\nFor more helpful reference images and inspiration, please see past examples I requested:  \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/15vlgpWHqhG_XyIYrZw4_dPvMcCHr6Q8s   \n\nThank you for your time.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/TSAs1uR", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@SddcARCxyjLYx2l/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2487659, "client_id": 177871, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2ea0cca3/uploads/origins/0fefeb83-3100-4a2d-ae35-2b539e676f83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b789b86831fb080b5ecbfa0b032c73f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2ea0cca3/uploads/origins/0fefeb83-3100-4a2d-ae35-2b539e676f83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b789b86831fb080b5ecbfa0b032c73f, https://si.imgix.net/2ea0cca3/uploads/origins/0fefeb83-3100-4a2d-ae35-2b539e676f83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61b88e716400b25e8ef383090c32bdca 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2ea0cca3/uploads/origins/0fefeb83-3100-4a2d-ae35-2b539e676f83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=71d8c763a3be4bf8b957def867a56e41 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2ea0cca3/uploads/origins/0fefeb83-3100-4a2d-ae35-2b539e676f83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b7644917e1c2e096d2188babed717ed6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2ea0cca3/uploads/origins/0fefeb83-3100-4a2d-ae35-2b539e676f83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b7644917e1c2e096d2188babed717ed6, https://si.imgix.net/2ea0cca3/uploads/origins/0fefeb83-3100-4a2d-ae35-2b539e676f83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=36744108e702f5bfba2ba9155340f21e 2x, https://si.img